msgid "HiNet Multi-Dial"
msgstr "HiNet 多重撥號"

msgid "HiNet Multi-Dial Controller"
msgstr "HiNet 多重撥號控制器"

msgid "Dial multiple PPPoE sessions over one physical WAN port, each with its own public IP. The DHCP WAN lifeline is never touched. <strong>Save &amp; Apply</strong> creates or removes the interfaces and reloads the network; the buttons in the status table act on running sessions live."
msgstr "透過單一實體 WAN 埠撥接多條 PPPoE 連線，每條各自取得一個公網 IP。DHCP WAN 主線路不會被更動。<strong>儲存並套用</strong>會建立或移除介面並重新載入網路；狀態表格中的按鈕則即時控制運行中的連線。"

msgid "Controller"
msgstr "控制器"

msgid "Number of sessions (IPs)"
msgstr "連線數量（IP 數）"

msgid "How many PPPoE sessions to dial. Each becomes wanp&lt;n&gt; with its own public IP and private routing table. Save &amp; Apply creates or removes interfaces to match."
msgstr "要撥接的 PPPoE 連線數量。每一條會成為擁有獨立公網 IP 與獨立路由表的 wanp&lt;n&gt; 介面。儲存並套用會依此建立或移除介面。"

msgid "HiNet account (HN number)"
msgstr "HiNet 帳號（HN 號碼）"

msgid "Enter just the 8-digit HN number — <code>@hinet.net</code> is added automatically. Shared by every session. For another ISP, enter the full account including <code>@</code>."
msgstr "只需填入 8 位數的 HN 號碼——系統會自動補上 <code>@hinet.net</code>。所有連線共用此帳號。若使用其他 ISP，請填入含 <code>@</code> 的完整帳號。"

msgid "Enter the 8-digit HN number, or a full account containing @."
msgstr "請輸入 8 位數的 HN 號碼，或含 @ 的完整帳號。"

msgid "PPPoE password"
msgstr "PPPoE 密碼"

msgid "Auto-dial at boot"
msgstr "開機時自動撥號"

msgid "When on, the sessions are dialed automatically at boot. When off they stay down until dialed here."
msgstr "開啟時，連線會在開機時自動撥接；關閉時則保持斷線，直到在此手動撥號。"

msgid "Initial delay (seconds)"
msgstr "初始延遲（秒）"

msgid "Wait this long after boot before the first dial, letting the DHCP WAN settle."
msgstr "開機後先等待這段時間再撥第一條連線，讓 DHCP WAN 先穩定。"

msgid "Delay between sessions (seconds)"
msgstr "各連線間延遲（秒）"

msgid "Gap between each dial — staggering avoids a burst of simultaneous PPPoE discovery frames."
msgstr "每次撥號之間的間隔——錯開撥號可避免同時送出大量 PPPoE 探索封包。"

msgid "Live Sessions"
msgstr "即時連線狀態"

msgid "Per-session control acts immediately on the running interface. The global buttons below dial or stop every session at once (staggered)."
msgstr "單條連線的控制會立即作用於運行中的介面。下方的全域按鈕則一次撥接或停止所有連線（錯開進行）。"

msgid "Dial all (staggered)"
msgstr "全部撥號（錯開）"

msgid "Stop all"
msgstr "全部停止"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "載入中…"

msgid "status unavailable"
msgstr "無法取得狀態"

msgid "No sessions yet. Set the account and number of sessions above, then Save & Apply."
msgstr "尚無連線。請在上方設定帳號與連線數量，然後儲存並套用。"

msgid "Session"
msgstr "連線"

msgid "State"
msgstr "狀態"

msgid "Public IP"
msgstr "公網 IP"

msgid "Uptime"
msgstr "連線時間"

msgid "Control"
msgstr "控制"

msgid "UP"
msgstr "已連線"

msgid "down"
msgstr "已斷線"

msgid "Dial"
msgstr "撥號"

msgid "Redial"
msgstr "重撥"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Dialing %s…"
msgstr "正在撥接 %s…"

msgid "Redialing %s…"
msgstr "正在重撥 %s…"

msgid "Stopping %s…"
msgstr "正在停止 %s…"

msgid "Dialing all sessions…"
msgstr "正在撥接所有連線…"

msgid "Stopping all sessions…"
msgstr "正在停止所有連線…"

msgid "Please wait"
msgstr "請稍候"

msgid "Failed: "
msgstr "失敗："

msgid "Applied. Interfaces are reconciling to the selected count…"
msgstr "已套用。介面正依所選數量進行調整…"

msgid "Apply failed: "
msgstr "套用失敗："
